HTTrack 3.50.2: copying keeps going in the background.

• On Android 14 and later, a copy keeps running when you leave the app or lock the screen, and picks up again if the system stops it
• A new option keeps the screen on while copying, which Android 13 and earlier still need
• A copy that lost links now says so, and offers to finish it
• With the cache off, continuing a copy no longer re-downloads the whole site